2026-10-13T16:23:28.8194249Z both empty), so the `admin` permission alone still opens these eight INSTANCE-GLOBAL
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8195625Z route groups to ANY admin-permissioned token, including one whose only membership is an
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8197063Z admin seat in a single workspace:
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8198018Z   1. POST|GET /v1/admin/self-update, POST /v1/admin/rollback, POST|GET /v1/admin/site-deploy
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8198887Z   2. GET /v1/plugins
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8199495Z   3. GET|PUT|DELETE /v1/plugins/settings/:plugin_name
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8200078Z   4. GET /v1/secrets, GET /v1/secrets/:name, GET /v1/secrets/:name/audit,
