2026-10-13T16:23:28.8201181Z   5. POST /v1/status/incidents, POST /v1/status/incidents/:id/resolve
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8201651Z   6. POST /api/playground
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8202036Z   7. POST /api/workspaces/:workspace_slug/import
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8202536Z   8. GET /v1/instance/site-deploy, GET /v1/instance/metrics
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8203474Z On a SINGLE-TENANT instance that is fine — the only admin is the operator. On a
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8204644Z MULTI-TENANT one it hands your first customer-admin the instance: run-secrets in
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8205483Z cleartext, the instance-wide plugin credentials record, and the release itself.
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8206404Z Set BARKPARK_OPERATOR_EMAILS (comma-separated operator emails) and/or BARKPARK_OPERATOR_TOKEN_IDS
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8207342Z (comma-separated api_token ids) to arm the allowlist; once either is non-empty the
2026-10-13T16:23:28.8208001Z eight groups are allowlist-only and fail closed.
